0.01: New App! Forked from gesture_symptoms_v2.
0.02: Fewer false positives: the password must start and end in silence, the pause must be twice the pair, the wrist must be still, and more than 5 taps cancels.
0.03: Field test: record real sessions for replay. Stillness judged during and after the password, and gives up early. No password out of a run of taps. Pause must be 2.3-5x the pair; drum rolls can't make the pair. Optional tap direction lock. Accelerometer stream only after a pair. Fewer widget redraws.
